        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour destination is Paris, France.\r\rYour targets are Martha Herris, companion to a notorious corrupt lawyer whose knowledge makes her a liability; Emil Lasalle, a billionaire whose ruthless investments have fueled conflicts and claimed millions of lives; and Hailey Brennan, Lasalle&apos;s trusted attorney, responsible for protecting his criminal empire from prosecution. Eliminate all three targets. I will leave you to prepare.",
